how we handle personal data collected through the website, in accordance with applicable UAE data-protection laws, including Federal Decree-Law No. 45 of 2021 on the Protection of Personal Data where applicable. Different rules may apply where another data-protection regime governs a particular relationship."}]]}],["$","section","Information we collect",{"className":"sd-legal-content__item","children":[["$","h5",null,{"className":"sd-legal-content__title","children":"Information we collect"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Depending on how you use the website, we may collect your name, email address, telephone number, company, city or emirate, inquiry type, product interests, requested quantity, and the message you send us. If you apply for a role, we may also collect your current company, portfolio or LinkedIn URL, resume URL, and application details. When you submit a form, technical information such as your IP address, browser user-agent, referrer, and submission time may also be recorded."}]]}],"$L9","$La","$Lb","$Lc","$Ld","$Le","$Lf","$L10"]]}]}]}]],null,"$L11"]}],{},null,false]},null,false]},null,false]},null,false],"$L12",false]],"m":"$undefined","G":["$13",[]],"s":false,"S":true}
